{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategy Roguelike x Noah's Ark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Noah's Dilemma</i></strong> is a crew-building strategy roguelike set in a reinvented mythology of Noah's Ark, featuring unique placement-centric gameplay inspired by sudoku and autochess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, you can look forward to:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 of the 4 sea areas with a governing boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 unique creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 diverse encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 items to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80 powerful relics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In short, it\u2019s almost like the full game\u2014but for now, you\u2019ll only experience the first map.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413220?t=1739948642","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413220?t=1739948642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413220/6ad10f747f95739f47e812bc0dff91fe952d6a70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739948642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413220/6ad10f747f95739f47e812bc0dff91fe952d6a70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739948642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategy Roguelike x Noah's Ark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Noah's Dilemma</i></strong> is a crew-building strategy roguelike set in a reinvented mythology of Noah's Ark, featuring unique placement-centric gameplay inspired by sudoku and autochess.</p><p class=\"b